cff-version: 1.2.0
message: Cite this wrapper and the exact model, Menagerie revision and MuJoCo version used by your experiment. Cite Blender for rendered results and Nichols et al. when using the wrist benchmark.
title: UsefulWrong / human-models-mcp
type: software
authors:
  - name: UsefulWrong contributors
version: 0.7.1
license: MIT
abstract: Local research toolkit for bounded musculoskeletal experiments with pinned MS-Human-700 assets, numerical evidence and saved-state Blender visualization. Model results are not human experimental or clinical validation.
